  "description": "Enterprise-grade logging SDK for .NET with file-based logging, distributed tracing, ASP.NET Core middleware, Format methods (log4net-compatible), Logger API (Node.js-style), and ILogger integration. Zero external dependencies except Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Abstractions. Supports .NET Framework 4.7.2+, .NET Standard 2.0, .NET Core 2.1+, .NET 6+, and .NET 8+.",
