  "releaseNotes": "v2.6.0: NEW ASP.NET Core Middleware for automatic HTTP request/response logging! Features: automatic trace context propagation (X-Trace-Id), request/response body capture, exception handling, configurable path exclusions, sensitive header filtering. Compatible with ASP.NET Core 2.1+, .NET 6+, .NET 8+. Similar to express-middleware in Node.js SDK.",
